#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-2.rst:5
#: 444e577de0ce4c9a88cf230ba5c6c960
msgid "Building for Bebop 2"
msgstr "为 Bebop 2 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-2.rst:7
#: 4e6f4e925a214d4fa8e41da1e4e13665
msgid ""
"These instructions explain how to use ArduPilot for the `Bebop2 "
"<https://www.parrot.com/us/drones/parrot-bebop-2?ref=#parrot-"
"bebop-2-details/>`__ on a Linux machine. The Bebop 2 is based on the same "
"architecture as the Bebop with a few noticeable changes, not the least being"
" a much better quality GPS (UBlox GPS with a bigger antenna)."
msgstr ""
"这些说明介绍如何在 Linux 机器上为 `Bebop2 <https://www.parrot.com/us/drones/parrot-"
"bebop-2?ref=#parrot-bebop-2-details/>`__ 使用 ArduPilot。Bebop 2 基于与 Bebop "
"相同的架构，但有一些显著变化，最值得注意的是配备了质量更好的 GPS（配有更大天线的 UBlox GPS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-2.rst:15
#: babcebc568ae4e6f86901f75a98677bc
msgid ""
"Making the changes described in this article will void your warranty! "
"Parrot's technical support will not help you with this hack or to recover "
"your original software."
msgstr "按照本文进行更改将使您的保修失效！Parrot 的技术支持不会帮助您解决此破解问题或恢复原始软件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-2.rst:21
#: 4d317a5bf03a48f993c2794872c758b0
msgid ""
"Hacking a commercial product is risky! This software is still evolving."
msgstr "破解商业产品存在风险！此软件仍在持续演进。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-2.rst:23
#: fc55ce078fc746a1b7c0f00c40d891e4
msgid ""
"That said, it is almost always possible to recover a drone and members of "
"the ardupilot dev team can likely help people hacking or recovering their "
"Bebop on `this google group <https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/bebop-"
"ardupilot>`__."
msgstr ""
"话虽如此，几乎总是可以恢复无人机，ArduPilot 开发团队成员可能会在 `此 Google 群组 "
"<https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/bebop-ardupilot>`__ 上帮助破解或恢复 Bebop "
"的人员。"

